<title>CROATIA: SOCCER-CROATIA DRAW 1-1 WITH GREECE IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER. [CORRECTED 22:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CROATIA DRAW 1-1 WITH GREECE IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER. [CORRECTED 22:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia and Greece drew  1-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in a World Cup European group one soccer</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Croatia - Davor Suker 45</p>
<p>Greece - Demis Nikolaidis 9</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> Greece		 4   2   1   1   7   3   7</p>
<p> Denmark		2   2   0   0   4   1   6</p>
<p> Croatia		2   1   1   0   5   2   4</p>
<p> Bosnia		 3   1   0   2   3   8   3</p>
<p> Slovenia	     3   0   0   3   1   6   0</p>
<p>(Corrects entries for Greece and Croatia).</p>
<p>Next match: March 29 Croatia v Denmark</p>
</text>
